   "he": "נָתְנוּ עֵירוּבָן בְּמָקוֹם אֶחָד וְשָׁכַח אֶחָד בֵּין מִן הַפְּנִימִית וְכוּ׳. מַאי מָקוֹם אֶחָד?",
   "en": "It was stated in the mishna: If the residents of both courtyards «put their eiruv in one place, and one» person, «whether» he was «from the inner» courtyard or from the outer one, «forgot» and did not contribute to the eiruv, it is prohibited to carry in both courtyards. The Gemara asks: «What is» the meaning of «one place?» Is the halakha different if the two courtyards established their eiruv in one place or in different places?"
  }
